T8 is safe as it's a single tile not part of any sequence.]\nReason: [T8 is a terminal tile with no adjacent tiles in hand for chows, minimizing risk. Keeping B3, W3, and sequences in T/B suits allows for future melds.]\nAnswer: Play T8"}
